<title>HUNGARY: KONZUM SWINGS TO H1 PRE-TAX PROFIT.</title>
<headline>KONZUM SWINGS TO H1 PRE-TAX PROFIT.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six-month period ending June 30.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>				     Jan-June 1997    Jan-June 1996</p>
<p>    Group operating result     24.9 loss   vs     124.2 loss</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax result	  4.9 profit vs     133.3 loss</p>
<p>    Group net sales	     768.2	  vs     575.6</p>
<p>	Domestic sales	    498.8	  vs     356.0</p>
<p>	Export sales		269.4	  vs     219.6</p>
<p>    Group other revenue	 119.6	  vs	 7.7</p>
<p>    Material expenditures     519.3	  vs     411.7</p>
<p>    Personnel expenditures    159.7	  vs     170.6</p>
<p>    Depreciation		   23.2	  vs	27.5</p>
<p>    Group other costs	   111.8	  vs     114.9</p>
<p>    Group other expenditures  121.1	  vs	21.7</p>
<p>    Net financial income	 31.4 profit vs	 6.4 profit</p>
<p>	Financial revenue	  63.7	  vs	46.4</p>
<p>	Financial expenditures   32.3	  vs	40.0</p>
<p>    Net extraordinary income    1.6 loss   vs	15.4 loss</p>
<p>	Extraordinary revenue     0.0	  vs	 0.01</p>
<p>	Extraordinary expend.     1.6	  vs	15.4</p>
<p>NOTE - Konzum Rt is a trading company. The figures are consolidated, were calculated in accordance with Hungarian Accounting Standards and are unaudited.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
